        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 8 The policy digest is part of the TPM key profile (see \"authPolicy\") and is created using the \"nameAlg\" algorithm of the key. In case of the default ECC algorithm as defined by [V2G20-2674], the EVCC's TPM policy digest uses SHA-512 and is 64 byte long (see Table 19).",
