        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 4 At the time of CertificateInstallationReq, if the SA intends to provide multiple different contract certificates based on different curves as defined by [V2G20-2674] and [V2G20-2319], the SA will need to send multiple different SignedInstallationData containers to the SECC and the EVCC can, at its/user's discretion, utilize the looping mechanism for CertificateInstallationReq to get and install all different contract certificates.",
